 The [.monospaced]#++AOU_AGGREGATOR_INFO++# submodule tracks outstanding AR transactions. For each issued AR, it records the original burst geometry (size, length) so that when wide R data returns from the manager side, the module can regenerate the correct slave-side [.monospaced]#++RLAST++# at the original burst boundaries. Wide R beats are presented to the slave side multiple times (once per original narrow beat) with the appropriate byte-lane selection.

